This repository contains original analysis scripts by Amal Varghese and 
derived materials from the replication package of:

Fortin-Gagnon, O., Leroux, M., Stevanovic, D. and Surprenant, S. (2022), 
"A Large Canadian Database for Macroeconomic Analysis", 
Canadian Journal of Economics, 55(4): 1799-1833. 
https://doi.org/10.1111/caje.12618

Replication data and code: https://doi.org/10.5683/SP3/VKTBBO

The derived materials are used under CC BY-NC 4.0. 
Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
